Error [E0631]: `x` can't be returned — it's a view into `arena`
  --> tests/ui/arena_view_escape.jet:8:12
    |
  8 |     return x
    |            ^
 Why: `x` borrows storage owned by `arena`; if it left this scope it would outlive `arena` and point into freed memory
 Fix: keep `x` inside the `arena` region, or copy what you need out with `.clone()` before it leaves
